---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: contract not paused
    q_check_published --> q_revert_state: acceptedCapital merkle not set
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert AcceptedCapitalNotPublished
    q_check_published --> q_check_claimed: accepted capital published
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_dup: position.hasClaimedExcess == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ExcessAlreadyClaimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: excess not yet claimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: Merkle proof invalid
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc: proof valid, decode acceptedAmount
    q_calc --> q_check_excess: excess = position.investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_zero: excess <= 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_check_excess --> q_update: excess > 0
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, excess), emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: excess = deposited commitment - project accepted amount
        INV-002: Merkle proof verifies per-investor accepted amount
    end note
